ace sitcom set at a Minneapolis TV station where Mary Richards (Moore) was a news writer and producer.\n\n7 MAD MEN\n\nCreated by Matthew Weiner\n\nMatt Weiner wrote the Mad Men pilot nearly a decade before it found a home as the first scripted drama at AMC, where"
