d a Golden Globe Best Actress in 2015- Actor\n\n- Producer\n\n- Director\n\nBorn Ryan Thomas Gosling in London, Ontario, Canada, he is the son of Donna (Wilson), a secretary, and Thomas Ray Gosling, a traveling salesman. Ryan"
